<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AI婚书·圣旨款</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;700;900&display=swap');

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    background-color: #1a0a00;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px;
    font-family: 'Noto Serif SC', 'STSong', '宋体', serif;
  }

  .scroll-outer {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 680px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #8B1A00 0%, #6B1200 8%, #8B1A00 50%, #6B1200 92%, #8B1A00 100%);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 18px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #D4AF37, 0 0 0 6px #8B1A00, 0 0 0 9px #D4AF37, 0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
  }

  .rod {
    width: 100%;
    height: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F5E6A3 0%, #D4AF37 30%, #AA8620 60%, #D4AF37 80%, #F5E6A3 100%);
    border-radius: 6px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,200,0.4);
    position: relative;
  }
  .rod::before, .rod::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #F5E6A3 0%, #D4AF37 40%, #8B6914 100%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
  .rod::before { left: -6px; }
  .rod::after { right: -6px; }

  .scroll-inner {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FDF6E3 0%, #FAF0D0 15%, #F5E6B8 50%, #FAF0D0 85%, #FDF6E3 100%);
    margin: 10px 0;
    padding: 32px 28px 28px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .border-frame {
    border: 2px solid #B8860B;
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 20px 18px;
    position: relative;
    background-color: rgba(255,248,220,0.3);
  }

  .corner {
    position: absolute;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    color: #8B1A00;
    font-size: 20px;
  }
  .corner.tl { top: -2px; left: -2px; }
  .corner.tr { top: -2px; right: -2px; transform: scaleX(-1); }
  .corner.bl { bottom: -2px; left: -2px; transform: scaleY(-1); }
  .corner.br { bottom: -2px; right: -2px; transform: scale(-1); }

  .edict-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .edict-preamble { font-size: 13px; color: #8B4513; letter-spacing: 3px; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .title-main { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #8B1A00; letter-spacing: 12px; display: block; line-height: 1.2; }
  .divider { text-align: center; color: #B8860B; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 8px; margin: 10px 0; }
  .edict-body { font-size: 15px; color: #3B1A00; line-height: 2.2; text-align: justify; margin: 14px 0; }
  .edict-body p { text-indent: 2em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .highlight { color: #8B1A00; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; }

  .names-section { display: flex; justify-content: space-around; align-items: center; margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(184,134,11,0.4); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184,134,11,0.4); }
  .name-block { text-align: center; }
  .name-label { font-size: 11px; color: #8B4513; letter-spacing: 3px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .name-value { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: #8B1A00; letter-spacing: 4px; }
  .heart-divider { font-size: 28px; color: #8B1A00; }

  .oath-section { background-color: rgba(139,26,0,0.05); border-left: 3px solid #8B1A00; padding: 10px 14px; margin: 14px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #5C2800; line-height: 2; }
  .seal-section { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-top: 20px; }
  .date-block { font-size: 12px; color: #8B4513; line-height: 2; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .seal { width: 90px; height: 90px; border: 3px solid #8B1A00; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background-color: rgba(139,26,0,0.08); transform: rotate(-8deg); box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(139,26,0,0.3); }
  .seal-text { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900; color: #8B1A00; text-align: center; }
  .footer-blessing { text-align: center; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 12px; color: #8B4513; letter-spacing: 4px; }
  .dragon-decor { text-align: center; font-size: 24px; color: rgba(139,26,0,0.2); letter-spacing: 20px; margin: 6px 0; }
  .screenshot-tip { text-align: center; margin-top: 14px; font-size: 11px; color: rgba(212,175,55,0.6); letter-spacing: 2px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="scroll-outer">
  <div class="rod"></div>
  <div class="scroll-inner">
    <div class="border-frame">
      <span class="corner tl">❧</span><span class="corner tr">❧</span>
      <span class="corner bl">❧</span><span class="corner br">❧</span>

      <div class="edict-header">
        <span class="edict-preamble">奉行天承运人工智能</span>
        <div class="dragon-decor">囍囍</div>
        <span class="title-main">结婚书</span>
      </div>

      <div class="divider">⸻ ✦ ⸻</div>

      <div class="edict-body">
        <p>兹有江汉平原女子<span class="highlight">茹茹</span>，心性纯良，才情出众，与佳偶<span class="highlight">良人</span>，志趣相投，情投意合。感天地之造化，结连理之良缘。</p>
        <p>值此良辰，盟誓于此，共结鸳鸯，白首不离。望后之岁月，柴米油盐，欢喜与共，贫富贵贱，永不相弃。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="names-section">
        <div class="name-block">
          <span class="name-label">新娘</span>
          <div class="name-value">茹茹</div>
        </div>
        <div class="heart-divider">❤</div>
        <div class="name-block">
          <span class="name-label">新郎</span>
          <div class="name-value">良人</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="oath-section">
        谨以白头之约，书向鸿笺，好将红叶之盟，载明鸳谱。此后山水一程，共赴风雨，执子之手，与子偕老。
      </div>

      <div class="seal-section">
        <div class="date-block">
          公元二〇二六年七月三日<br>
          立契于数字天地
        </div>
        <div class="seal">
          <div class="seal-text">永结<br>同心</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-blessing">— 执手共赴，此生不渝 —</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="rod"></div>
  <div class="screenshot-tip">长按即可保存属于你的AI婚书</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
